      },
      "text": "TRADITIONAL STRUCTURAL DESIGN:\n  Engineer assumes a structural form (beam, column, truss).\n  Calculates stress, checks against limits, adjusts sizes.\n  Form is predetermined; optimization is of sizes only."
    },
    {
      "id": "09-CONTEMPORARY.md#017",
      "path": [
        "09-CONTEMPORARY.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:architecture-history:09-contemporary, git-history:architecture-history:09-contemporary]",
        "canonical_path": "architecture-history/09-CONTEMPORARY.md",
