      "text": "```\nBIM vs. CAD: THE FUNDAMENTAL DIFFERENCE\n========================================="
    },
    {
      "id": "09-CONTEMPORARY.md#025",
      "path": [
        "09-CONTEMPORARY.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
