        "section": "architecture-history",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Contemporary Architecture",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "CLASH DETECTION:\n    Structural beam and HVAC duct in the same space?\n    The software flags it automatically.\n    (In traditional 2D: discovered on site → expensive fix.)"
    },
    {
      "id": "09-CONTEMPORARY.md#028",
      "path": [
